WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.568
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.568 --> 00:00:05.738
How is Karen in Michigan doing
tonight?

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:08.941
[ Laughter ]
Let's get to the news.

00:00:08.941 --> 00:00:12.044
President Biden yesterday ended
infrastructure negotiations

00:00:12.044 --> 00:00:15.048
with Republican Senator Shelley
Moore Capito

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:18.051
and opened talks with
another group of GOP lawmakers,

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:20.019
led by Senator Bill Cassidy.

00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:22.821
Dude, you can keep searching,
but you're not going to find

00:00:22.821 --> 00:00:25.158
a reasonable group
of GOP senators.

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:27.326
You're like a woman who says,
"Maybe if I go

00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:29.495
to a different
Buffalo Wild Wings,

00:00:29.495 --> 00:00:30.930
I'll find a husband."

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.732
[ Light laughter ]
During an interview this week

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:34.500
with NBC news anchor
Lester Holt,

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.003
Vice President Kamala Harris
defended

00:00:37.003 --> 00:00:39.005
the migrant situation
at the southern "bordah" --

00:00:39.005 --> 00:00:40.973
border -- excuse me --
and said,

00:00:40.973 --> 00:00:42.942
"There's not going to be
a quick fix."

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:45.845
I don't know, it seemed like
you had one the other day.

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:49.783
-Do not come. Do not come.

00:00:49.783 --> 00:00:51.583
-According to a recent poll,

00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:54.387
Brooklyn Borough President
Eric Adams leads the field

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:56.856
in the New York
mayoral Democratic primary,

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:59.459
ahead of former presidential
hopeful Andrew Yang.

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:01.894
Said Yang, "What the hell
is Brooklyn?"

00:01:01.894 --> 00:01:03.195
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:03.195 --> 00:01:06.466
Right-wing cable channel Newsmax
reportedly turned down

00:01:06.466 --> 00:01:08.901
Florida Congressman Matt Gaetz
earlier this year,

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:10.936
after he approached them
about a job.

00:01:10.936 --> 00:01:13.872
But if you knew what kind of job
he was asking for,

00:01:13.872 --> 00:01:15.307
you'd turn him down, too.

00:01:15.307 --> 00:01:18.845
Federal Prosecutors recently
arrested a Pennsylvania man

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:21.214
who allegedly posed
as former President Trump

00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:24.017
to collect funds for a fake
re-election organization

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:27.220
but instead used the money
for personal expenses.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:29.889
What did they charge him with?
Plagiarism?

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:33.125
Starbucks announced yesterday
it's reintroducing

00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:34.927
its 10-cent discount

00:01:34.927 --> 00:01:38.197
for customers who bring
personal reusable cups.

00:01:38.197 --> 00:01:41.033
Meanwhile, Dunkin' customers
can save a buck

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:42.835
if they just
hold out their hands.

00:01:42.835 --> 00:01:44.504
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:46.973
That's right.
That's our Dunkin' customer?

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:48.541
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:51.678
[ Laughing ] Feel -- Feel
like that fights the joke.

00:01:51.678 --> 00:01:53.546
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:56.783
"Off to my business meeting!"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:59.252
Ford yesterday unveiled

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:02.221
its new hybrid engine
compact pickup truck.

00:02:02.221 --> 00:02:04.156
So if you love
driving a pickup,

00:02:04.156 --> 00:02:05.724
but you care
about the environment,

00:02:05.724 --> 00:02:08.027
I kind of just want
to learn more about you.

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:09.429
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:11.497
And finally, a travel agency
has announced plans

00:02:11.497 --> 00:02:13.933
to offer a "Friends"-themed
cruise next year.

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:15.968
And nothing says
"I miss the '90s"

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:17.904
more than still using
a travel agent.

00:02:17.904 --> 00:02:19.906
And that, everybody,
was a monologue.

